Cell["\<\
The four minimal connected separators in the band 1 to 2 about the centre of \
a 5 by 5 grid, each drawn on its own.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"861dc2e7-9b68-43ae-b860-e6310671fa23"],

